<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places first credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places first credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has placed the first of two credits whereby it sought to inject 2.301 billion pesos in the secondary market on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM    AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>1.301 bln  6 days  32.06 pct</p>
<p>1.000 bln  1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559</p>
